  "notes": "{建|た}て{替|か}える is a compound verb meaning to rebuild. It combines {建|た}てる (to build) and {替|か}える (to replace).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nNOTE: Do not confuse with {立|た}て{替|か}える (to pay on someone's behalf), which has the same reading but different kanji and meaning.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {家|いえ}を{建|た}て{替|か}える (rebuild a house)\n- {建物|たてもの}を{建|た}て{替|か}える (rebuild a building)",
